WEBVTT

NOTE
Voiced by Tello (AI voice). Timings match the voiced video.

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.807
Things to teach before your students run an RCFE.

00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:13.649
Keeping records up to date. Completing required documentation. Tracking staff certifications. And documenting safety checks.

00:00:14.249 --> 00:00:18.161
But don't just teach them what to check. Teach them how to keep track of it.

00:00:18.761 --> 00:00:25.553
Show them how to spot missing forms, expiring certifications, overdue reports and documentation gaps.

00:00:26.153 --> 00:00:29.404
Show them tools they can use after the training ends.

00:00:30.004 --> 00:00:33.788
Are you a DSS-approved trainer? Teach with Title22.
